HI, Colin, <br>I'm working on a solution to add a GPS receiver to the DM1701. I found that the ATGM336H module for arduino sold on aliexpress for ~$4 fits easily in the DM1701.<br>Looking at the code , the GPS on/off function is compiled out of the firmware, so I'll have to generate a new image.<br>Do you know what would be the best GPIO pin to power the GPS module ? ( I can then add the turn on/off function back in the firmware)<br>I see that in non MDUV380 radios usart0 is used for the GPS data input. Do you know if  this is  available in the DM1701 or should I use another one ?<br><br>Thanks,<br>73's<br>Luca<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=1214">ve2wkr</a> — Thu Apr 20, 2023 4:31 pm</p><hr />
